==Battleground==
*6 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Casaurian Ahirujo]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*5 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
In this stage, you can use the Combos [[Biohazard (Combo)|Biohazard]], [[Bony Bone (Combo)|Bony Bone]] and any Attack Up Combo along with [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier]], 2 meatshields and a strong [[Wave Attack]] unit (preferably [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]] or [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Gross]]).

